OL,3,AHenry Nowak's killer's appeal
OL,4,A'ludicrous', says family
OL,5,
OL,6,FDigwa stabbed Henry, from Chafford
OL,7,FHundred in Essex, five times with an
OL,8,Feight-inch blade in Southampton on 3
OL,9,FDecember ` and lied to police that the
OL,10,Fstudent had started the altercation and
OL,11,Fracially abused him.
